    "id": "variety-058",
    "document": "variety",
    "requirement": "- **Storm.** One country is drawn uniformly, and a size of 3 or 4, equally likely. The storm strikes a connected group of countries of that size containing the drawn country, drawn uniformly among all such groups. Each struck stack is replaced by a whole number drawn uniformly from 1 to a bound: for a stack above 6, half the stack rounded down, minus one; for a stack of 1 to 6, the stack minus one; the bound is at least 1. From 20 armies a stack keeps 1 to 9; a 6-army stack keeps 1 to 5; a 1-army stack is unchanged. Owners do not change.",
    "citation": "https://github.com/diegoami/isle-wars-archaeology/blob/ae298e37c2f5177039e55767607f9345b6cb0e7a/design/variety.md#the-kinds-of-event",
