    "requirement": "1. **Storms on a generated board** (V8, C-HAZ-04). The predecessor struck a block of 3 or 4 consecutively numbered countries and never the first one. Numbers mean nothing on a generated board, so a storm strikes a connected group of 3 or 4 countries; the first-country exception goes.",
