    "id": "variety-079",
    "document": "variety",
    "requirement": "4. **When events are paused** (V9, C-HAZ-03). The predecessor paused events for the first six player-turns and while any seat held more than 38 countries; T50 pauses them in round 1 and within 4 countries of a win, and V12 adds the round limit's last 3 rounds. The rates and the one-turn cooldown are the predecessor's; its \"never\" setting is the Off option.",
    "citation": "https://github.com/diegoami/isle-wars-archaeology/blob/ae298e37c2f5177039e55767607f9345b6cb0e7a/design/variety.md#reconciled-with-t50",
